<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paging Network.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential Securities analyst Mike Elling added Paging Network Inc to his &quot;single best idea&quot; list, the analyst's office said.</p>
<p>-- said keeps Paging Network's rating as buy.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Paging Network gained 15/16 to 15 in morning trading.</p>
</text>
